Storage layout (default cache_dir = ~/openclaw-output/hailo-vision-cache/):
  - cache.db          SQLite, table vision_facts(content_hash, model_version,
                      pipeline_version) PRIMARY KEY (content_hash, model_version,
                      pipeline_version)
  - embeddings.parquet  pyarrow sidecar; CLIP 512-d vectors keyed by content_hash

